{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_050_1000_p", "source_sha256": "548718df3dcab2e695a2aa7daa1ae67cd06c6fab13f5ef3ae5a43dff25bf16ae", "ja": "（次の劇場公演用に頼んでおいた曲が届いた。\n歌ってもらうのは……おっ、いたいた）", "zh": "（为下一场剧场公演拜托创作的歌曲送到了。\n要让谁来唱呢……哦，找到了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_050_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f573b2eaea15f2bfc8eb907c1bc872745cbedfaf9a3fcab1560528b2e200ebfd", "ja": "瑞希！　海美と美希も一緒か、ちょうどよかった。\n瑞希とふたりに、話があるんだ。", "zh": "瑞希！海美和美希也在一起啊，正好。\n我有话要跟你们两个人说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_050_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "029c8b06e82a0fb6994c8f5e72a12f79f0c2d33211dfd080f3e9c65644f86d58", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}。\n私たちに、話、ですか。……なんだろう。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n是有话要对我们说吗？……会是什么呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_050_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "816fa70bdad167794b1834871f2510fddc5bd00b72500af5bb75ae11e9043a86", "ja": "みずきんと、ミキミキと、私でしょ？\n……あっ、わかった！　女子力についてだ！", "zh": "有瑞希、美希，还有我对吧？\n……啊，我知道了！是关于女子力的对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_050_1004_p", "source_sha256": "0878cf9225cfb81a714b097daa5e8dcd43b62cc7e514bccf3d65935414fd37f6", "ja": "女子力？", "zh": "女子力？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_050_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "313d90e8e58ce1d81b4d0212785ab073ec5f90dccbc22038c32bd0ab8fd8bb40", "ja": "すみません、{$P$}。\nそれに関しては、まだ勉強中です。……しゅん。", "zh": "对不起，{$P$}。\n关于这个，我还在学习中……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_050_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "cab3cab00b321242fe2cb7c7350531159e553468788e84a31fffb082ff14f3db", "ja": "{$P$}も、女子力欲しいの？\nそれならミキ、先生やってみてもいいかな？", "zh": "{$P$}也想要女子力吗？\n那样的话，美希要不要来当老师试试？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_050_1007_p", "source_sha256": "e794fc2aa4f19c0e5971f0ad9481ec22ef8272bc4fc965ff8994a3c381d5719d", "ja": "いや、別に欲しくはないけど……\nというか、先生って？", "zh": "倒也没有特别想要……\n话说回来，老师是指？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_050_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "ca521b8ee69ce400cc6ee3096c431552d1ee4d0bb6a9f6b4d5b8ba441debbb26", "ja": "そうそうっ！　ミキミキの女子力が最強だから、\n弟子入りしようって、みずきんと話してたんだ！", "zh": "对对！美希美希的女孩子力最强了，所以我刚才还和瑞希商量着要不要拜她为师呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_050_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "e246fee7927212e60ce9545462dd727c9c50567ea7cc90a47f1b23ae629ffe29", "ja": "私たちでは、星井さんになれません。\nけど、もしかしたら。あるいは。……チャンスが。", "zh": "我们是成不了星井前辈那样的人。\n不过，也许……或许……还是有机会的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_050_1010_p", "source_sha256": "df2c34210c37cb1b235286fe7c7201f5ec8aab37486ff9ce0fd6f21ea845c10c", "ja": "いや、そんなに悲観しなくても……というか、\nそろそろ俺の話を聞いて欲しいんだけど、いいかな。", "zh": "不，不用那么悲观啦……话说回来，\n差不多也该听我把话说完了吧，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_050_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "c72978a79956c9ad794f1a610780a1f59efd0fc7f2c9a49e612477d05d0934e5", "ja": "あ、そうでした。\nどうぞ、{$P$}。お話を。", "zh": "啊，对哦。  \n请说吧，{$P$}。我听着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_050_1012_p", "source_sha256": "f9d6dc72e912b663b6e9dfe74b7c47385910f821db184b993ae2080ea890b28d", "ja": "ありがとう。それじゃ、早速だけど……\n次の公演が決まったんだ。というわけで、瑞希。", "zh": "谢谢。那么，我就直奔主题了……\n下一场公演已经定下来了。所以说，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_050_1035", "source_sha256": "8f778f4294be03b6239188dc1167c4befc3c5236ab4b99fd0e7f9347ac880084", "ja": "新曲を渡す", "zh": "交付新曲", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_050_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "0dfa26451c32a351911bd28091fc3110a181fa38403b9a43f862159d322f727f", "ja": "はい。……{$P$}。\n思わず受け取ってしまいましたが、これは何でしょう？", "zh": "好的。……{$P$}。\n不由自主地就接过来了，这是什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_050_1014_p", "source_sha256": "9a7397812ec8e2fecdf0ad4fb3f985ef973f80a2061cfe7574dbe93ef8a3f7b5", "ja": "何って、瑞希の新曲だよ。次の公演で\nお披露目だから、よろしくな！", "zh": "不是说了嘛，这是瑞希的新歌。下次公演要首次演出，可要加油啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_050_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "8aa75a08316dfeaa8ab809784c84f92a40a3270456cd1c753200ddfb7707432b", "ja": "新曲。……私の？", "zh": "新歌……是我的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_050_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "25199647b436115880da8e4322de0bf2a9419f6276ca881e29c426fc9a304599", "ja": "えっ、みずきん新曲もらったの！？　いいな～！\n{$P$}、私も聴きたいっ！", "zh": "咦，瑞希拿到新歌了！？真好啊～！\n{$P$}，我也想听！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_050_1017_003mik", "source_sha256": "7b0727df4d0a3c1dcbf4c9e1c7e61e33f54d1e1125bd5e16ff4926ef5680d9c2", "ja": "ミキも聴いてみたいな。\n{$P$}、瑞希、ダメ？", "zh": "美希也想听听看。\n{$P$}，瑞希，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_050_1018_p", "source_sha256": "d996a5a5dd392bc4954a145984375c84c55c75b6bfd54d8b785c7498ae459488", "ja": "瑞希がいいならいいんじゃないか？\nどうだ、瑞希。", "zh": "如果瑞希觉得可以，那就没问题吧？\n怎么样，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_050_1019_044miz", "source_sha256": "e1273f8f3d68e51314375d73160872f7a09de6703a8c0a4dff904678537f9545", "ja": "あ、はい。もちろん、かまいません。\nおふたりとも、よかったら一緒に聴いてください。", "zh": "啊，好的。当然没问题。\n两位要是不介意的话，也请一起听吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_050_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "84a38224fe97c8b887abb7d34323d44b0c0f54f4f0f2548f1c107255c2e9b6f4", "ja": "やったーっ！\n{$P$}、早く早くっ！", "zh": "太好了——！\n{$P$}，快点快点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_050_1021_p", "source_sha256": "4172b820a73abe1d9e2a8bbfce625254610f036f5d91cacb127e63bea9c98b85", "ja": "はは、わかったわかった。\nそれじゃ、かけるぞ。", "zh": "哈哈，知道了知道了。\n那我就开始咯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_050_1023_044miz", "source_sha256": "6371c880bf2be3bfa0ecc0d0977d61171dedfdd664552edcbac5a478b7a3a508", "ja": "これは……。", "zh": "这是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_050_1024_029umi", "source_sha256": "86473bd817b1bae470655d2e2fbf7d8a3c212f2c78310659744dc8dc7127507e", "ja": "わぁ～ッ！　すごい、カッコイイよ、みずきん！\nいいないいな、うらやましいっ！", "zh": "哇～！好厉害，好帅气啊，瑞希！\n真好啊真好啊，好羡慕！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_050_1025_003mik", "source_sha256": "2e3eb54e9e50e84b8e46c52f71aa9777ce860319a714ef0471f2cc0801192bd9", "ja": "うん、いいカンジだね。\nミキもちょっと、歌ってみたいかも。", "zh": "嗯，感觉不错。\n美希也有点想唱唱看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_050_1026_p", "source_sha256": "e62d0d4e4d2c40c21f80eb9f99bcfd32b57064cd858b337b0dd373434b42003f", "ja": "瑞希はどうだ？", "zh": "瑞希觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_050_1027_044miz", "source_sha256": "07e8ebd7e92072a6dd5efaff0a9c4ac034330f5c8331f0a50514eff6d7ba82e8", "ja": "はい。とても、カッコイイ曲だと思います。\n第一印象は、クール。……けど、とても熱い。", "zh": "是的。我觉得这是一首非常帅气的歌。\n第一印象是，很酷。……但又非常热烈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_050_1028_p", "source_sha256": "76b0b897c82416d45e9eabcfa2c7d4ee816ad470280e792e7056b048f688a1d5", "ja": "うん。この曲で、ファンの人達に\n瑞希の新しい一面を届けたいと思ってるんだ。", "zh": "嗯。我想用这首歌，\n向粉丝们展现瑞希崭新的一面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_050_1029_044miz", "source_sha256": "e3fbc8b5c8e89f59722671ff890c8dc631dc6d3c9853bc096087dbf0788803ea", "ja": "私の、新しい一面ですか。\n……。", "zh": "我的全新一面吗……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_050_1030_p", "source_sha256": "048f6fc38522992685a80e722c182cb4437ae74017cb409875d999c852f9824c", "ja": "来週から早速、公演に向けてのレッスンが始まる。\nみんな、よろしく頼んだ！", "zh": "从下周开始，就要马上进行面向公演的训练了。\n大家，拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_050_1031_044miz", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_050_1032_029umi", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_050_1033_003mik", "source_sha256": "458b622b7be6c4cfab0152570a25ed7f10036eda926724e4f31afee4376c10d3", "ja": "はいなの！", "zh": "好唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_050_1034_p", "source_sha256": "4e2464a959f3164464a37af3b7c63b9d14b5f22aec10db4b8976860be4e22b38", "ja": "（瑞希の新しい曲、そしてメンバー達……\nどんな化学反応を起こすか、楽しみだな！）", "zh": "（不知道瑞希的新歌，以及成员们……\n会产生怎样的化学反应，真让人期待啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
